 Analytic Imaging Facility and shared instrumentation grant 1S10OD016214-01A1 for the use of the JEOL 1400Plus TEM. We thank A. Phillip West, Ross Levine, Coleman Lindsley, and Courtney Jones for their critical input into this project.</p></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="author-information" data-title="Author information"><div class="c-article-section" id="author-information-section"><h2 class="c-article-section__title js-section-title js-c-reading-companion-sections-item" id="author-information">Author information</h2><div class="c-article-section__content" id="author-information-content"><h3 class="c-article__sub-heading" id="affiliations">Authors and Affiliations</h3><ol class="c-article-author-affiliation__list"><li id="Aff1"><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__address">The Jackson Laboratory, Bar Harbor, ME, USA</p><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__authors-list">Kira A. Young, Jayna J. Mistry, Xiurong Cai, Brandon T. James, Griffin J. Nye, Natalie R. Fournier &amp; Jennifer J. Trowbridge</p></li><li id="Aff2"><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__address">Princess Margaret Cancer Centre, University Health Network, Toronto, ON, Canada</p><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__authors-list">Mohsen Hosseini, Veronique Voisin, Ali Chegini, Aaron D. Schimmer, Gary D. Bader, Grace Egan &amp; Steven M. Chan</p></li><li id="Aff3"><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__address">Ruth L. and David S. Gottesman Institute for Stem Cell and Regenerative Medicine Research, Departments of Cell Biology, Oncology and Medicine, Montefiore Einstein Cancer Center, Albert Einstein College of Medicine, Bronx, NY, USA</p><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__authors-list">Claudia Morganti &amp; Keisuke Ito</p></li><li id="Aff4"><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__address">Division of Hematology, Department of Immunology and Microbiology, Anschutz Medical Campus, University of Colorado, Aurora, CO, USA</p><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__author